Copyright 2020 The Klee Project Authors (https://github.com/fontworks-fonts/Klee)

License: SIL Open Font License 1.1.
Full license text: `public/fonts/OFL-KleeOne.txt`.

### Caveat

Copyright 2014 The Caveat Project Authors (https://github.com/googlefonts/caveat)

License: SIL Open Font License 1.1.
Full license text: `public/fonts/OFL-Caveat.txt`.

The full text of the SIL Open Font License 1.1 is included in the files above
and is also available at https://scripts.sil.org/OFL.

